  Schmitt persistence-without-guarantee) from rejected ones (modes, profiles,
  capital/resistance variables, external environment, Clausewitz layer).
- README.md now documents actual implementation state of simulation.py (energy as
  consumable pool, Schmitt trigger with scale-free ON(F), logistic rest, capture
  end condition with guaranteed survival) — resolves stale description gap.
- Code consistency: ON_THRESHOLD in simulation.py converted to an explicit
  historical-comment (was unused dead constant referenced by docs); experiment
  scripts patched to use current scale-free thresholds (ON_FRAC/OFF_FRAC) and to
  import simulation from repo root; verified syntax + smoke game runs.
- No architecture changes: pure IPO automaton + two metrics preserved.
